{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>泰奶天花板!網民:好飲到一日飲3杯</p><p>泰奶界天花板Karun登港！</p><p>喜歡泰式奶茶的朋友，相信對 Karun Thai Tea 一定不會陌生。這個來自泰國的精品泰奶品牌，最近宣布登陸香港，選址啟德Airside，預計10月開幕！與一般街邊泰奶相比，Karun 更重視茶底的風味表現，入口茶香濃郁，味道順滑醇厚，被譽為「泰奶界Hermes」，是不少旅客到曼谷必試的泰奶品牌。</p><p>濃厚茶香招牌泰式奶茶！</p><p>招牌 Traditional Thai Tea茶湯色澤橙亮，入口先有濃厚茶香，隨後帶出奶香，口感豐富而不單調。除了經典冰奶茶，亦供應泰奶冰沙、熱泰奶、黑茶等特色口味，其中泰奶冰沙口感細滑，濃郁茶香與冰涼質感結合，適合炎熱天氣享用。</p><p>Karun Thai Tea 地址：啟德Airside 2樓220 舖（預計10月開幕） 官方IG：@karunthaitea</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178696105741181213_8188942816a82dca1c0558.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178696105913053175_15798238026a82dca43aa21.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178696106220267348_19383149766a82dca6a8c86.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17869610639668506_13278184026a82dca84d5b3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178696106564827872_1600893616a82dca9eb7b9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178696106730793561_14068823046a82dcabbbb19.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178696106914041215_9185451846a82dcad6a0ca.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T10:10:14.580574+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":449,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}